Z||000000||Tweek||06-22-2001||03:52 AM||||I got to watch it the day before it came out AND for free =) (the movies places have to watch em the day before to make sure they work right, and I have connections  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">)<P>Anyways... Its a fun movie, but you have to ignore the fact that its all souped up Jap cars (Im being PC here). Other than that, just get into the adreniline of it all and its pretty fun. That WAS a nice GTO (I think) at the end, kind of a tribute to good ol cubic inches. The exhaust notes of all but one car are pretty annoying though, I still have buzzing in my ears. Decent story too, not all black and white, kinda grayish if you know what I mean.<P>If you think you can get past the bias most of us have here towards american cars, the I recommend it. I am a bit concerned about the kids who think they can drive like that in theirs after seeing it.<P>Cheers,<BR>Ted||||reg||10
