Z||000018||Pontiaddict||06-25-2001||07:43 PM||||I noticed the seatbelt thing too.<P>Comparing a 10 second eclipse to a Ferrari is like comparing apples to oranges, the Eclipse would win in the quarter but the Ferrari would eat it alive on the highway either when the Mitsu redlines at a lower speed or when the N2O runs out.<BR>Not that it mattered since the race against the Ferrari was with a Supra and the Supra had a Japaneese race motor before they laid a hand on the car (Wasn't that what the big deal the "team" was making, was about?.)<P>I can see where you wouldn't want to hit the nitrous off the like on a front driver and the other cars were so traction limited that it wouldn't be of any help there either.<P>Was that pukey green car the one guy was driving a Focus? (solid color, no hood, no stickers, chrome everywhere in the engine bay) I didn't get a good look at it but my friends said it was and I wasn't sure.||||reg||1
