Z||000020||Tigger||06-30-2001||01:17 AM||||Just saw the movie tonight.  I've waited to look at this thread to avoid any bias.<P>Well, I think the movie was ok, not bad.<BR>Had some good scenes, and like all movies it had some stupid moments.<P>Product placement is always name of the game, how many movies have you seen and you notice ALL of the cars used are Ford, Chrysler, or GM???  What are the actors supposed to do, lean over and turn on the "Nitro Brand X" bottle?  People who know, know NOS anyway.<P>As far as the low cars and the stunts.  Hey, how many Chargers did they destroy in the "Dukes of Hazzard?"  Same thing here, jumping cars over hills isn't going to be good for them, but hey it's all fun!<P>Noticed the seatbelt and helmet thing.  Figure it was a "Hollywood thing", hard to see the actors expressions and whatnot.<P>Noticed Mia, umm... couldn't tell you the names of the other characters.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/tongue.gif"><BR>||||reg||14
